The '''Royal Palace''' is a castle in [[Dwarven Mines]], where players can find the [[King|Dwarven Kings]].

{{ZoneText|Long live the King(s)!|Talk to the &dPuzzler&f.}}

== Overview ==
The '''Royal Palace''' is home to the [[King]]s and {{NPCSprite|Queen Mismyla}}, as well as several {{NPCSprite|Castle Guard}}s. Here, players can access their [[Commissions]]. The [[Raffle]] event can take place here.

The '''Royal Palace''' branches into the {{Zone|Grand Library}}, {{Zone|Royal Quarters}}, {{Zone|Barracks of Heroes}}, and {{Zone|Hanging Court}}.

